                <head><seg type="margin">[170]</seg> *<hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Barlow, United States marshal, to Mr. Fish, Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-10-07"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi>
                        7, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of State</hi>:</p>
                <p>I get rumor that Hornet will run out of Wilmington, in defiance of the United
                    States authorities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FRANCIS C. BARLOW.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
